---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: "Settling in"
description: "Online communities for digital nomads and expats in Korea."
---
<div class="content-page">
<header class="region-header">
  <span class="region-header__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <h1>Settling in</h1>
  <p class="region-header__intro">
    Online groups where digital nomads and foreign residents in Korea share advice, meet up, and
    swap regional tips. Verify a group is still active before joining — links here are a starting
    point, not an endorsement.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="region-section">
  {% if communities.length %}
  <ul class="community-list">
    {% for c in communities %}
    <li class="community-card">
      <h2>{{ c.name }}</h2>
      {# Platform badge always links out — to the specific group once c.url is sourced, to the
         platform's own homepage (platformUrl) as the honest "not yet sourced" state until then.
         The card name itself stays plain text; the platform is the one outbound link per card. #}
      <p class="community-card__platform"><a href="{{ c.url or c.platformUrl }}">{{ c.platform }} ↗</a></p>
      <p>{{ c.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  {% set message = "No communities listed yet." %}
  {% include "partials/empty-state.njk" %}
  {% endif %}
</section>
</div>
